description:
Rare/Obscure/Hard to Find book & tape story produced by by Ted Kryczko (one meant to be heard in a regular cassette deck, not Worlds of Wonder’s Talking Mickey Mouse. Hence why there’s a narrator (William/Bill Woodson) and it’s not ‘just’ the characters speaking their dialogue);
One thing that’s interesting about this is it features Wayne Allwine as Mickey & Tony Anselmo as Donald (usually it’s Peter Renaday & Sam Kwasman in this era of book & tape sets & toys), aswell as the great Will Ryan (R.I.P.) as the voice of Pete. Enjoy!

This tape has been out of print for decades and is being uploaded strictly for preservation, educational, & archival purposes as a result. Enjoy! All rights go to The Walt Disney Company. and any other original rights holders. If any of the original rights holders have any issue, either comment below or send a message here for removal. Thanks!

A rare 1988 Mickey Mouse read-along book & tape story, ‘Mickey’s Tattered Tale’, produced by Ted Kryczko (one meant to be heard in a regular cassette deck, not Worlds of Wonder’s Talking Mickey Mouse. Hence why there’s a narrator (William/Bill Woodson) and it’s not ‘just’ the characters speaking their dialogue);
 One thing that’s interesting about this is it features Wayne Allwine as Mickey (usually it’s Peter Renaday in this era of book & tape sets & toys), and Russi Taylor plays Minnie (again, usually a different voice actress for this type of thing). Anyway, Enjoy!


This tape has been out of print for decades and is being uploaded strictly for preservation, educational, & archival purposes as a result. Enjoy! All rights go to The Walt Disney Company. and any other original rights holders. If any of the original rights holders have any issue, either comment below or send a message here for removal. Thanks!
